Usage:
  hedgehug view [flags]
  hedgehug view [command]

Available Commands:
  list        List the saved views
  rename      Rename a saved view
  rm          Remove a saved view
  save        Save a view, or change the settings given of a saved one
  show        List the tasks of a saved view

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for view

Global Flags:
      --json           print JSON
      --no-color       do not color the output
      --store string   the store to work on, by name

Use "hedgehug view [command] --help" for more information about a command.
hedgehug: a subcommand is needed
